{"text": "FEB OL '34 @4z4aert PII MARKETING SERVICES Pee\n\nPHILIP MORRIS INTERNATIONAL INC. _INTER-OFFICE CORRESPONDENCE\n300 WESTCHESTER AVENUE, RYE BROOK, NEW YORK 10873-1307\n\nDATE: February 1, 1994\n\nTO: Distribution\nFROM: Alice Liu\nSUBJECT: 998 Worl M Monitor\nFRANKIE SO\n\nWith one month of 1994 already behind us, we are deeply involved in preparation\nof the 1993 Worldwide Marlboro Monitor. Thus far, we have received tables and\n\u2018management reports from the following markets for the 1993 Marlboro Monitor:\n\n+ Saudi Arabia\n= Singapore\n- Turkey\nWe would appreciate receiving your 1993 Marlboro Monitor data as the\ninformation becomes available and at your earliest convenience.\n\n\u2018Additional areas we would like to include in the 1993 Monitor are:\n\n- Profile of the LIN smokers (i.e. male/female & YAS);\n\n- YAS share in flavor segments, and,\n~ Share of starters (starters in past 2 years) for Marlboro & major\n\ncompetitors.\n\nWe would appreciate receiving this information for your market from 1989\nthrough 1993 if available.\nIfyou have any questions, please gpntact us as soon as possible, Thank yoypfor\n\nyour continued support\n\nae 0 ae\n\nce: D, Dangoor\nA. Bachmann J, Gonzalez J. Scully\nT.Doti P, Herzog F.So\nD, Drummond-Duna J. Hogan N. Udagawa\nM. Hulit\n\nI. Ferguson\n\n122600hosz",
